  "description": "Operating Area: India\n\nBoarding Point: Jetty no 5, opp. Taj Mahal Hotel, Gateway of India.\n\nPrincess is 61 footer luxurious yacht one of its kind on the Mumbai harbour with spacious deck views of the entire ocean from a distance which enables us to enjoy its scenic beauty It has 3 rooms and 3 washroom and a capacity of 25 guests. Princess 61 is of exceptional design and quality, packed with features, unprecedented safe and easy handling and real open sea comfort.\nThe bedrooms are fully equipped with teak wood furnished bathrooms, television screen and a DVD player.\nThe yacht has different levels of decks, the upper deck can accommodate 10 people at a time, the rear deck about 8 people, the front deck is the perfect place to have a photo-shoot or selfie for the entire group which also has a sunbathing mat, which also creates comfort which your enjoying your entire cruising.\nThe kitchen is fully furnished with crockery, cutlery and glasses and heating facility with a dining table so the entire buffet can be served well, which is attached to the saloon room.\nThe boat has speakers where one can use an iPod or attach their phones to play music\nThe yacht is chartered for special celebrations of birthday, anniversary, and romantic dinner on the yachts for couples at a great deal. Having a good capacity for a big group, we have lots of corporate get together and party on the yachts.\nPrincess is a beauty of its own which speaks for elegance, luxury, space and seamless performance on the Mumbai harbour.\nThe yacht is very popular for photo shoots for pre wedding, short add films, movies, day trips or even destination trips to Mandwa (Alibaug)\nHoney mooners can add a special evening having a romantic experience on the yachts, couples deals will be very cost effective and attractive.\nThe above price includes a transfer boat ride to the yacht, once you reach the yacht there will be 120 mins (2 hours) of charter time (1 hour cruising and 1 hour anchor) and then again, one is sent back on the same transfer boat to the shore.\nPreferred Morning slots: 7 to 9 am and 9 to 11am\nEvening Slots: 2 to 4pm, 4 to 6pm, 6 to 8pm (No 5 to 7pm available)\n3rd hour and 4th hour requirement can be discussed if required with the customer care before booking.",
